<title>UK: Centrica up as Hoare Govett raises to &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Centrica up as Hoare Govett raises to &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Centrica Plc rose in active trade on Thursday as analysts at ABN AMRO Hoare Govett raised the stock to a &quot;buy&quot; from a &quot;hold&quot; and set a price target of 73p, dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2-1/2p at 66-3/4 by 1127 GMT in volume of 17.6 million shares, making it the most active stock in the UK market by a wide margin.</p>
<p>Analysts at Hoare Govett, one of the company's brokers, were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 552 4367</p>
